@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
# 회원가입·평점 등록 응답의 실제 ID로 아래 값을 바꾸세요.
@memberId = 1
@ratingId = 1

### 회원가입 (재실행 시 이메일/닉네임 변경)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"umc@example.com","nickname":"moviefan","password":"Umc!1234"}

### 평점 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{"movieId":550,"score":5,"comment":"좋은 영화"}

### 평점 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}/ratings/{{ratingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"score":4,"comment":"수정한 후기"}

### 평점 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}/ratings

### 평점 삭제 (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}/ratings/{{ratingId}}

### 소수 별점 (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members/{{memberId}}/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{"movieId":155,"score":2.5}
